x months ended June 30, 2026 and 2025. &#160;</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">For the three months ended June 30, 2026 and 2025, the Company incurred amortization expense of intangible assets of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_MVqbR5FJ0U6fOMa3AqCYNg" contextRef="Duration_4_1_2026_To_6_30_2026_0AvV6Kx3XESFNAk3gBMlRg" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:AmortizationOfIntangibleAssets" scale="3" id="Narr_y2x_bc9VHUWE55sj4ExsPw">17</ix:nonFraction> and $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_MVqbR5FJ0U6fOMa3AqCYNg" contextRef="Duration_4_1_2025_To_6_30_2025_zeQIreHQvUeo1T9qShwsig" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:AmortizationOfIntangibleAssets" scale="3" id="Narr_wB6YIvjReE6hba9u89DRCg">12</ix:nonFraction>, respectively. &#160;For the six months ended June 30, 2026 and 2025, the Company incurred amortization expense of intangible assets of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_MVqbR5FJ0U6fOMa3AqCYNg" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2026_To_6_30_2026_3Dw6FUpMvUaA4CG1u9ySIQ" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:AmortizationOfIntangibleAssets" scale="3" id="Narr_wVLpsF2L7U2Pnc0iCLp1CA">34</ix:nonFraction> and $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_MVqbR5FJ0U6fOMa3AqCYNg" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_6_30_2025_xr9e5E0ZbU-JDC8eDxQJGw" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:AmortizationOfIntangibleAssets" scale="3" id="Narr_Mu8K3v_k-EKm-ZD90CB46Q">21</ix:nonFraction>, respectively.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><span style="margin-bottom:12pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:bold;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">Accrued Expenses and other</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:just